  {
   "block_uid": "doc-12f45ca9:0:2",
   "block_type": "title",
   "page_idx": 0,
   "block_seq": 2,
   "plain_text": "6.1 一般规定",
   "bbox": [
    0.446,
    0.242,
    0.602,
    0.26
   ],
   "derived_level": 2,
   "parent_uid": "doc-12f45ca9:0:1",
   "source": "ocr",
   "confidence": 1.0,
   "image_path": null,
   "table_html": null,
   "math_content": null,
   "formula_body": null,
   "formula_number": null
  },
  {
   "block_uid": "doc-12f45ca9:0:3",
   "block_type": "paragraph",
   "page_idx": 0,
   "block_seq": 3,
   "plain_text": "6.1.1 航道、锚地及导助航设施总体设计的主要内容应包括航道建设规模、航道作业标准、航道选线、航道与锚地平面布置和主尺度确定、疏浚工程和导助航设施布置等。涉及整治工程的航道工程，总体设计还应包括整治标准确定，整治线和整治建筑物布置。",
   "bbox": [
    0.143,
    0.275,
    0.901,
    0.338
   ],
   "derived_level": 3,
   "parent_uid": "doc-12f45ca9:0:2",
   "source": "text",
   "confidence": 1.0,
   "image_path": null,
   "table_html": null,
   "math_content": null,
   "formula_body": null,
   "formula_number": null
  },
  {
   "block_uid": "doc-12f45ca9:0:4",
   "block_type": "paragraph",
   "page_idx": 0,
   "block_seq": 4,
   "plain_text": "6.1.2 航道选线和锚地选择应全面分析当地自然条件,并应对海床稳定性、船舶通航安全等进行论证。涉及疏浚的工程,尚应论证可挖性与可维护性,评价疏浚土可利用性和提出处置方案。",
   "bbox": [
    0.145,
    0.341,
    0.901,
    0.403
   ],
   "derived_level": 3,
   "parent_uid": "doc-12f45ca9:0:2",
   "source": "text",
   "confidence": 1.0,
   "image_path": null,
   "table_html": null,
   "math_content": null,
   "formula_body": null,
   "formula_number": null
  },
  {
   "block_uid": "doc-12f45ca9:0:5",
   "block_type": "paragraph",
   "page_idx": 0,
   "block_seq": 5,
   "plain_text": "6.1.3 水动力等自然条件、通航条件复杂的航道工程,宜采用船舶操纵模拟技术研究确定航道的布置和尺度。",
   "bbox": [
    0.145,
    0.407,
    0.901,
    0.446
   ],
   "derived_level": 3,
   "parent_uid": "doc-12f45ca9:0:2",
   "source": "text",
   "confidence": 1.0,
   "image_path": null,
   "table_html": null,
   "math_content": null,
   "formula_body": null,
   "formula_number": null
  },
  {
   "block_uid": "doc-12f45ca9:0:6",
   "block_type": "paragraph",
   "page_idx": 0,
   "block_seq": 6,
   "plain_text": "6.1.4 改扩建航道、锚地的布置应充分利用原有航道和锚地设施。",
   "bbox": [
    0.145,
    0.45,
    0.712,
    0.467
   ],
   "derived_level": 3,
   "parent_uid": "doc-12f45ca9:0:2",
   "source": "text",
   "confidence": 1.0,
   "image_path": null,
   "table_html": null,
   "math_content": null,
   "formula_body": null,
   "formula_number": null
  },
  {
   "block_uid": "doc-12f45ca9:0:7",
   "block_type": "paragraph",
   "page_idx": 0,
   "block_seq": 7,
   "plain_text": "6.1.5 港口、航道应设置导助航设施，锚地可根据需要设置助航设施。",
   "bbox": [
    0.145,
    0.472,
    0.743,
    0.49
   ],
   "derived_level": 3,
   "parent_uid": "doc-12f45ca9:0:2",
   "source": "text",
   "confidence": 1.0,
   "image_path": null,
   "table_html": null,
   "math_content": null,
   "formula_body": null,
   "formula_number": null
  },
  {
   "block_uid": "doc-12f45ca9:0:8",
   "block_type": "paragraph",
   "page_idx": 0,
   "block_seq": 8,
   "plain_text": "6.1.6 对存在浮泥的淤泥质海港,在保证船舶航行和靠离泊安全的基础上,经论证,可适当利用淤泥层的适航水深。",
   "bbox": [
    0.145,
    0.494,
    0.901,
    0.534
   ],
   "derived_level": 3,
   "parent_uid": "doc-12f45ca9:0:2",
   "source": "text",
   "confidence": 1.0,
   "image_path": null,
   "table_html": null,
   "math_content": null,
   "formula_body": null,
   "formula_number": null
  },
  {
   "block_uid": "doc-12f45ca9:0:9",
   "block_type": "title",
   "page_idx": 0,
   "block_seq": 9,
   "plain_text": "6.2 航道建设规模及航行标准",
   "bbox": [
    0.385,
    0.549,
    0.661,
    0.567
   ],
   "derived_level": 2,
   "parent_uid": "doc-12f45ca9:0:1",
   "source": "ocr",
   "confidence": 1.0,
   "image_path": null,
   "table_html": null,
   "math_content": null,
   "formula_body": null,
   "formula_number": null
  },
  {
   "block_uid": "doc-12f45ca9:0:10",
   "block_type": "paragraph",
   "page_idx": 0,
   "block_seq": 10,
   "plain_text": "6.2.1 航道建设规模应根据货运量、船型、船流密度、自然条件和港口发展状况等因素，经技术经济论证后确定，并应根据实际情况确定是否分期实施。",
   "bbox": [
    0.145,
    0.581,
    0.898,
    0.621
   ],
   "derived_level": 3,
   "parent_uid": "doc-12f45ca9:0:9",
   "source": "text",
   "confidence": 1.0,
   "image_path": null,
   "table_html": null,
   "math_content": null,
   "formula_body": null,
   "formula_number": null
  },
  {
   "block_uid": "doc-12f45ca9:0:11",
   "block_type": "paragraph",
   "page_idx": 0,
   "block_seq": 11,
   "plain_text": "6.2.2 航道设计船型应根据设计水平年内港口规模、泊位情况、货种情况、船舶实际营运情况和船型尺度等确定。",
   "bbox": [
    0.145,
    0.625,
    0.901,
    0.665
   ],
   "derived_level": 3,
   "parent_uid": "doc-12f45ca9:0:9",
   "source": "text",
   "confidence": 1.0,
   "image_path": null,
   "table_html": null,
   "math_content": null,
   "formula_body": null,
   "formula_number": null
  },
  {
   "block_uid": "doc-12f45ca9:0:12",
   "block_type": "paragraph",
   "page_idx": 0,
   "block_seq": 12,
   "plain_text": "6.2.3 航道线数应根据航道通过能力满足船舶通行要求的程度,经技术经济论证确定。",
   "bbox": [
    0.145,
    0.669,
    0.89,
    0.687
   ],
   "derived_level": 3,
   "parent_uid": "doc-12f45ca9:0:9",
   "source": "text",
   "confidence": 1.0,
   "image_path": null,
   "table_html": null,
   "math_content": null,
   "formula_body": null,
   "formula_number": null
  },
  {
   "block_uid": "doc-12f45ca9:0:13",
   "block_type": "paragraph",
   "page_idx": 0,
   "block_seq": 13,
   "plain_text": "6.2.4 航道内船流密度较大,经论证有必要使大、小船或重载、空载船多道航行时,可采用复式航道。复式航道中,大船航道和小船航道的布设应根据航行方式、疏浚工程量和港内泊位分布情况等因素确定。",
   "bbox": [
    0.145,
    0.69,
    0.901,
    0.753
   ],
   "derived_level": 3,
   "parent_uid": "doc-12f45ca9:0:9",
   "source": "text",
   "confidence": 1.0,
   "image_path": null,
   "table_html": null,
   "math_content": null,
   "formula_body": null,
   "formula_number": null
  },
  {
   "block_uid": "doc-12f45ca9:0:14",
   "block_type": "paragraph",
   "page_idx": 0,
   "block_seq": 14,
   "plain_text": "6.2.5 航道的设计航速应根据设计船型、航道条件、通航环境、通航安全管理条件和工程经济性等通过综合分析确定。",
   "bbox": [
    0.145,
    0.756,
    0.901,
    0.797
   ],
   "derived_level": 3,
   "parent_uid": "doc-12f45ca9:0:9",
   "source": "text",
   "confidence": 1.0,
   "image_path": null,
   "table_html": null,
   "math_content": null,
   "formula_body": null,
   "formula_number": null
  },
  {
   "block_uid": "doc-12f45ca9:0:15",
   "block_type": "paragraph",
   "page_idx": 0,
   "block_seq": 15,
   "plain_text": "6.2.6 航道的通航作业标准应根据当地水文、气象条件的特点,结合通航要求确定,并应与港口作业标准相协调。",
   "bbox": [
    0.145,
    0.8,
    0.901,
    0.841
   ],
   "derived_level": 3,
   "parent_uid": "doc-12f45ca9:0:9",
   "source": "text",
   "confidence": 1.0,
   "image_path": null,
   "table_html": null,
   "math_content": null,
   "formula_body": null,
   "formula_number": null
  },
  {
   "block_uid": "doc-12f45ca9:0:16",
   "block_type": "paragraph",
   "page_idx": 0,
   "block_seq": 16,
   "plain_text": "6.2.7 航道设计通航水位应根据各类船型对通航保证率的要求、港口所在地区的潮汐特征和疏浚工程量等因素分析确定。通常情况下可取设计低水位或乘潮水位；对于有全潮通航需要的航道，通航水位宜取理论最低潮面。",
   "bbox": [
    0.145,
    0.844,
    0.903,
    0.907
   ],
   "derived_level": 3,
   "parent_uid": "doc-12f45ca9:0:9",
   "source": "ocr",
   "confidence": 1.0,
   "image_path": null,
   "table_html": null,
   "math_content": null,
   "formula_body": null,
   "formula_number": null
  },
  {
   "block_uid": "doc-12f45ca9:0:17",
   "block_type": "page_header",
   "page_idx": 0,
   "block_seq": 17,
   "plain_text": "6 进港航道、锚地及导助航设施",
   "bbox": [
