  },
  {
   "block_uid": "doc-12f45ca9:1:1",
   "block_type": "paragraph",
   "page_idx": 1,
   "block_seq": 1,
   "plain_text": "6.2.8 乘潮水位应根据需要乘潮的船舶航行密度、航行持续时间，结合所在地区潮汐特征、航道沿程潮位过程和疏浚工程量等因素合理确定，并应符合下列规定。",
   "bbox": [
    0.091,
    0.1,
    0.849,
    0.141
   ],
   "derived_level": 3,
   "parent_uid": "doc-12f45ca9:0:9",
   "source": "text",
   "confidence": 1.0,
   "image_path": null,
   "table_html": null,
   "math_content": null,
   "formula_body": null,
   "formula_number": null
  },
  {
   "block_uid": "doc-12f45ca9:1:2",
   "block_type": "paragraph",
   "page_idx": 1,
   "block_seq": 2,
   "plain_text": "6.2.8.1 每潮次船舶乘潮进出港所需的持续时间可按式(6.2.8)确定,对于有冰冻的港口,应考虑冰凌影响船舶航行、转头、靠离码头所增加的时间。",
   "bbox": [
    0.094,
    0.144,
    0.849,
    0.184
   ],
   "derived_level": 4,
   "parent_uid": "doc-12f45ca9:1:1",
   "source": "text",
   "confidence": 1.0,
   "image_path": null,
   "table_html": null,
   "math_content": null,
   "formula_body": null,
   "formula_number": null
  },
  {
   "block_uid": "doc-12f45ca9:1:3",
   "block_type": "equation_interline",
   "page_idx": 1,
   "block_seq": 3,
   "plain_text": "t _ {s} = K _ {t} (t _ {1} + t _ {2} + t _ {3})\\tag{6.2.8}",
   "bbox": [
    0.39,
    0.189,
    0.549,
    0.207
   ],
   "derived_level": 5,
   "parent_uid": "doc-12f45ca9:1:2",
   "source": "formula",
   "confidence": 1.0,
   "image_path": "images/d30b7cf79e053708be5dfc42a6134d24376323354c1084e92f3dd731c1c677f9.jpg",
   "table_html": null,
   "math_content": "t _ {s} = K _ {t} (t _ {1} + t _ {2} + t _ {3})\\tag{6.2.8}",
   "formula_body": "t _ {s} = K _ {t} (t _ {1} + t _ {2} + t _ {3})",
   "formula_number": "6.2.8"
  },
  {
   "block_uid": "doc-12f45ca9:1:4",
   "block_type": "paragraph",
   "page_idx": 1,
   "block_seq": 4,
   "plain_text": "式中   t_{a}  ——每潮次船舶乘潮进出港所需的持续时间(h);",
   "bbox": [
    0.094,
    0.209,
    0.589,
    0.227
   ],
   "derived_level": 6,
   "parent_uid": "doc-12f45ca9:1:3",
   "source": "text",
   "confidence": 1.0,
   "image_path": null,
   "table_html": null,
   "math_content": null,
   "formula_body": null,
   "formula_number": null
  },
  {
   "block_uid": "doc-12f45ca9:1:5",
   "block_type": "paragraph",
   "page_idx": 1,
   "block_seq": 5,
   "plain_text": "K_{t} ——时间富裕系数,取1.1~1.3;",
   "bbox": [
    0.148,
    0.232,
    0.452,
    0.249
   ],
   "derived_level": 6,
   "parent_uid": "doc-12f45ca9:1:3",
   "source": "text",
   "confidence": 1.0,
   "image_path": null,
   "table_html": null,
   "math_content": null,
   "formula_body": null,
   "formula_number": null
  },
  {
   "block_uid": "doc-12f45ca9:1:6",
   "block_type": "paragraph",
   "page_idx": 1,
   "block_seq": 6,
   "plain_text": "t_{1} ——每潮次船舶通过航道的持续时间(h)，其中包括船舶间追踪航行的间隔时间；",
   "bbox": [
    0.151,
    0.253,
    0.849,
    0.293
   ],
   "derived_level": 6,
   "parent_uid": "doc-12f45ca9:1:3",
   "source": "text",
   "confidence": 1.0,
   "image_path": null,
   "table_html": null,
   "math_content": null,
   "formula_body": null,
   "formula_number": null
  },
  {
   "block_uid": "doc-12f45ca9:1:7",
   "block_type": "paragraph",
   "page_idx": 1,
   "block_seq": 7,
   "plain_text": "t_{2} ——一艘船舶在港内转头的时间(h);",
   "bbox": [
    0.151,
    0.296,
    0.491,
    0.316
   ],
   "derived_level": 6,
   "parent_uid": "doc-12f45ca9:1:3",
   "source": "text",
   "confidence": 1.0,
   "image_path": null,
   "table_html": null,
   "math_content": null,
   "formula_body": null,
   "formula_number": null
  },
  {
   "block_uid": "doc-12f45ca9:1:8",
   "block_type": "paragraph",
   "page_idx": 1,
   "block_seq": 8,
   "plain_text": "t_{3} ——一艘船舶靠离码头的时间(h)。",
   "bbox": [
    0.151,
    0.32,
    0.472,
    0.338
   ],
   "derived_level": 6,
   "parent_uid": "doc-12f45ca9:1:3",
   "source": "text",
   "confidence": 1.0,
   "image_path": null,
   "table_html": null,
   "math_content": null,
   "formula_body": null,
   "formula_number": null
  },
  {
   "block_uid": "doc-12f45ca9:1:9",
   "block_type": "paragraph",
   "page_idx": 1,
   "block_seq": 9,
   "plain_text": "6.2.8.2 单一潮位站的乘潮水位应按现行行业标准《港口与航道水文规范》(JTS 145)的有关规定进行统计,且应有一年以上的实测潮位资料。乘潮水位可取与每潮次船舶乘潮进出港所需的持续时间相对应的乘潮累积频率90%~95%的水位;对通行大型船舶次数较少的航道,乘潮累积频率可适当降低。",
   "bbox": [
    0.094,
    0.341,
    0.849,
    0.425
   ],
   "derived_level": 4,
   "parent_uid": "doc-12f45ca9:1:1",
   "source": "text",
   "confidence": 1.0,
   "image_path": null,
   "table_html": null,
   "math_content": null,
   "formula_body": null,
   "formula_number": null
  },
  {
   "block_uid": "doc-12f45ca9:1:10",
   "block_type": "paragraph",
   "page_idx": 1,
   "block_seq": 10,
   "plain_text": "6.2.8.3 当潮位受气象影响季节性变化较大时,对所选用的乘潮水位,应核算低水位月份的航道通过能力及其对港口正常营运的影响。",
   "bbox": [
    0.094,
    0.427,
    0.849,
    0.469
   ],
   "derived_level": 4,
   "parent_uid": "doc-12f45ca9:1:1",
   "source": "text",
   "confidence": 1.0,
   "image_path": null,
   "table_html": null,
   "math_content": null,
   "formula_body": null,
   "formula_number": null
  },
  {
   "block_uid": "doc-12f45ca9:1:11",
   "block_type": "paragraph",
   "page_idx": 1,
   "block_seq": 11,
   "plain_text": "6.2.9 在水流条件变化可以预测的水域,当避开对船舶航行最不利的时段,对船舶安全明显有利且工程投资较为节省时,可选择以某一流速对应的延时作为通航时段。",
   "bbox": [
    0.093,
    0.472,
    0.849,
    0.513
   ],
   "derived_level": 3,
   "parent_uid": "doc-12f45ca9:0:9",
   "source": "text",
   "confidence": 1.0,
   "image_path": null,
   "table_html": null,
   "math_content": null,
   "formula_body": null,
   "formula_number": null
  },
  {
   "block_uid": "doc-12f45ca9:1:12",
   "block_type": "paragraph",
   "page_idx": 1,
   "block_seq": 12,
   "plain_text": "6.2.10 航道设计通过能力应综合考虑设计水平年的交通流情况、自然条件、航道条件和航道服务水平等因素,可采用排队论、经验估算等方法确定,必要时宜采用交通流仿真模拟分析。需要通过航道的货运量或船舶艘次超过航道的合理通过能力时,单线航道宜扩建为双线或多线航道。",
   "bbox": [
    0.091,
    0.516,
    0.849,
    0.601
   ],
   "derived_level": 3,
   "parent_uid": "doc-12f45ca9:0:9",
   "source": "text",
   "confidence": 1.0,
   "image_path": null,
   "table_html": null,
   "math_content": null,
   "formula_body": null,
   "formula_number": null
  },
  {
   "block_uid": "doc-12f45ca9:1:13",
   "block_type": "title",
   "page_idx": 1,
   "block_seq": 13,
   "plain_text": "6.3 航道选线与轴线布置",
   "bbox": [
    0.352,
    0.614,
    0.589,
    0.633
   ],
   "derived_level": 2,
   "parent_uid": "doc-12f45ca9:0:1",
   "source": "ocr",
   "confidence": 1.0,
   "image_path": null,
   "table_html": null,
   "math_content": null,
   "formula_body": null,
   "formula_number": null
  },
  {
   "block_uid": "doc-12f45ca9:1:14",
   "block_type": "paragraph",
   "page_idx": 1,
   "block_seq": 14,
   "plain_text": "6.3.1 航道选线应满足船舶航行安全要求,结合港口总体规划、当地自然条件、交通流、引航条件、工程量和维护费用等因素综合确定,并应适当留有发展余地。",
   "bbox": [
    0.091,
    0.646,
    0.849,
    0.688
   ],
   "derived_level": 3,
   "parent_uid": "doc-12f45ca9:1:13",
   "source": "text",
   "confidence": 1.0,
   "image_path": null,
   "table_html": null,
   "math_content": null,
   "formula_body": null,
   "formula_number": null
  },
  {
   "block_uid": "doc-12f45ca9:1:15",
   "block_type": "paragraph",
   "page_idx": 1,
   "block_seq": 15,
   "plain_text": "6.3.2 航道选线应全面分析当地自然条件,宜充分利用天然水深,避免大量开挖岩石、暗礁和底质不稳定的浅滩,并应对航道泥沙回淤做出论证。通常情况下应减小强风、强浪和水流主流向与航道轴线的交角。",
   "bbox": [
    0.093,
    0.69,
    0.849,
    0.753
   ],
   "derived_level": 3,
   "parent_uid": "doc-12f45ca9:1:13",
   "source": "ocr",
   "confidence": 1.0,
   "image_path": null,
   "table_html": null,
   "math_content": null,
   "formula_body": null,
   "formula_number": null
  },
  {
   "block_uid": "doc-12f45ca9:1:16",
   "block_type": "paragraph",
   "page_idx": 1,
   "block_seq": 16,
   "plain_text": "6.3.3 航道轴线宜顺直,避免多次转向。受地形、地质条件限制必须多次转向时,宜采取减小转向角、加长两次转向间距、加大回旋半径或适当加宽航道等措施。",
   "bbox": [
    0.091,
    0.756,
    0.849,
    0.797
   ],
   "derived_level": 3,
   "parent_uid": "doc-12f45ca9:1:13",
   "source": "text",
   "confidence": 1.0,
   "image_path": null,
   "table_html": null,
   "math_content": null,
   "formula_body": null,
   "formula_number": null
  },
  {
   "block_uid": "doc-12f45ca9:1:17",
   "block_type": "paragraph",
   "page_idx": 1,
   "block_seq": 17,
   "plain_text": "6.3.4 浅滩段航道轴线布置应分析水动力及泥沙对航道的影响,并应分析浅滩演变与航道轴线布置之间的关系。有整治工程时,航道轴线还应结合对整治效果的预测进行布置。",
   "bbox": [
    0.091,
    0.8,
    0.849,
    0.841
   ],
   "derived_level": 3,
   "parent_uid": "doc-12f45ca9:1:13",
   "source": "text",
   "confidence": 1.0,
   "image_path": null,
   "table_html": null,
   "math_content": null,
   "formula_body": null,
   "formula_number": null
  },
  {
   "block_uid": "doc-12f45ca9:1:18",
   "block_type": "paragraph",
   "page_idx": 1,
   "block_seq": 18,
   "plain_text": "6.3.5 受潮汐影响的河口航道,宜利用天然深槽。需穿越河口浅滩时,应着重分析河流、海洋动力和泥沙对航道的影响,分析河口滩、槽的稳定性。必要时应通过模型试验论证后采取适当的工程措施。",
   "bbox": [
    0.093,
    0.844,
    0.849,
    0.906
   ],
   "derived_level": 3,
   "parent_uid": "doc-12f45ca9:1:13",
